de>Blog::create([...])</code> <code>await Blog().create(&lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...})</code> <code>Blog::firstOrCreate([...], [...])</code> <code>await Blog().firstOrCreate(&lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...}, &lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...})</code> <code>Blog::firstOrNew([...])</code> <code>await Blog().firstOrNew(&lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...})</code> <code>Blog::updateOrCreate([...], [...])</code> <code>await Blog().updateOrCreate(&lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...}, &lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...})</code> <code>$blog-&gt;save()</code> <code>await blog.save()</code> <code>$blog-&gt;delete()</code> <code>await blog.delete()</code> (returns the deleted rows as an <code>int</code>) <code>$blog-&gt;increment('views')</code> <code>await blog.increment('views')</code> <code>$blog-&gt;update([...])</code> <code>await blog.update(&lt;String, dynamic&gt;{...})</code> (only that row, sets <code>updated_at</code>, no model events) <code>Blog::withTrashed()</code> <code>Blog().withTrash()</code> <code>Blog::onlyTrashed()</code> <code>Blog().onlyTrashed()</code> <code>$blog-&gt;touch()</code> <code>await blog.touch()</code> <code>$blog-&gt;replicate()</code> <code>blog.replicate()</code> <code>$blog-&gt;restore()</code> <code>await blog.restore()</code> <code>Blog::with('posts')-&gt;get()</code> <code>await Blog().preload('posts').get()</code> <code>$blog-&gt;load('posts')</code> <code>await blog.$getRelation('posts')</code> <code>$user-&gt;posts()-&gt;where(...)-&gt;get()</code> <code>user.related&lt;Post&gt;('posts')?.where(...).get()</code> <code>User::whereHas('posts', fn ($q) =&gt; ...)</code> <code>User().whereHas('posts', (QueryBuilder&lt;dynamic&gt; q) { ... })</code> <code>orWhereHas</code>, <code>whereDoesntHave</code>, <code>orWhereDoesntHave</code> the same names <code>User::has('posts', '&gt;=', 3)</code> <code>User().has('posts', '&gt;=', 3)</code> <code>whereHas('posts.comments')</code> <code>whereHas('posts.comments')</code> <code>$with = ['posts']</code> <code>@HasMany(Post, eager